  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEm">III Em</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et dictum est investigatione et quaesitione [pecoris furati], ut ad villam pervestigetur, et non sit foristeallum aliquod illi vel aliqua prohibitio itineris vel quaestionis.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we have declared with regard to the tracking and pursuit of stolen cattle, that thorough investigation shall be made at the village, and that no obstacle shall be placed in the way thereof or anything to prevent the pursuit and search.</ab>
      </div>
